---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site, locations, isFilled } from '@/data/site';

// NOTE: This is a sensible Ontario (PHIPA/PIPEDA) starting point. Have it
// reviewed and approved by your own legal counsel before launch, and fill in
// the bracketed placeholders (legal entity, Privacy Officer, etc.).
const effective = 'June 19, 2026';
const contactAddress = locations[0]?.address;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.brand} collects, uses, and protects your personal information, including under Ontario's PHIPA and Canada's PIPEDA.`}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal · Your privacy" lead="We treat your personal information with the same care we bring to everything else. This policy explains what we collect, why, and the choices you have.">
    Privacy, <span class="it">handled with care.</span>
  </PageHeader>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="wrap-narrow legal">
      <p class="legal__meta">Effective {effective}</p>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how {site.brand} (&ldquo;we,&rdquo;
        &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) collects, uses, discloses, and
        protects your personal information when you visit our website or contact
        us. We are committed to handling your information in accordance with
        Ontario&rsquo;s <em>Personal Health Information Protection Act</em>
        (PHIPA) and Canada&rsquo;s <em>Personal Information Protection and
        Electronic Documents Act</em> (PIPEDA).
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Information we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you use our consult or
        contact forms, we collect the details you choose to provide, such as your
        name, email address, phone number, your preferred location, and any
        message or area of interest you share (for example, the concern that
        brought you in or a treatment you are curious about).</p>
      <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most
        websites, we may collect limited technical information through your
        browser, such as your device type, general location, and how you move
        through the site. We use this only to keep the site working well and to
        understand, in aggregate, how it is used.</p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Personal health information</h2>
      <p>
        Our website forms are intended to start a conversation, not to collect a
        medical history. Please do not send detailed health information through
        the website. Any personal health information you share with us during a
        consultation or course of care is collected and safeguarded as part of
        your clinical record, in accordance with PHIPA, and is handled separately
        from this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">How we use your information</h2>
      <ul class="legal__list">
        <li>To respond to your enquiry and arrange a consultation;</li>
        <li>To provide, coordinate, and follow up on the care or information you request;</li>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve our website;</li>
        <li>To meet our legal, regulatory, and professional obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for
        third-party advertising.</p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Consent</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting a form or contacting us, you consent to our collecting and
        using your information for the purposes described above. You may withdraw
        your consent at any time, subject to legal or professional record-keeping
        requirements, by contacting us using the details below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand how the site is
        used in aggregate. Where cookies or similar technologies are used, you
        can control them through your browser settings. We will update this
        section if our use of analytics changes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">How we share information</h2>
      <p>We share personal information only as needed to serve you and run the
        clinic, including with:</p>
      <ul class="legal__list">
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who help us operate, such as our
          website host and the provider that delivers form submissions to us, who
          are permitted to use your information only to perform services for us;</li>
        <li><strong>Regulatory or legal authorities</strong> where required or
          permitted by law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal__h">How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep personal information only as long as necessary to fulfil the
        purposes described in this policy or as required by law and our
        professional obligations, after which it is securely destroyed or
        de-identified.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">How we protect it</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to
        protect your information against loss, theft, and unauthorized access,
        use, or disclosure. No method of transmission over the internet is
        completely secure, so please avoid sending sensitive details through the
        website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Your rights and choices</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, you may:</p>
      <ul class="legal__list">
        <li>Ask what personal information we hold about you and request access to it;</li>
        <li>Ask us to correct information that is inaccurate or incomplete;</li>
        <li>Withdraw your consent or ask us to stop contacting you;</li>
        <li>Raise a concern about how we have handled your information.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If we cannot resolve your concern, you may contact the Information and
        Privacy Commissioner of Ontario or the Office of the Privacy Commissioner
        of Canada.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Other websites</h2>
      <p>
        Our site may link to third-party websites or services we do not control.
        Their privacy practices are their own, and we encourage you to review
        their policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children through the site without the involvement of a
        parent or guardian.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The effective date above
        shows when it was last revised, and material changes will be reflected
        here.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal__h">Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy question or request, please contact our Privacy Officer:
      </p>
      <p class="legal__contact">
        {site.brand}<br />
        {isFilled(contactAddress) && (<>{contactAddress}<br /></>)}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        {isFilled(site.phone) && (<><br />{site.phone}</>)}
      </p>

      <p class="legal__note">
        This policy is provided for general information and is not legal advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal__meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mist);
  }
  .legal__h {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .legal__list li {
    padding-left: 0.2rem;
  }
  .legal__contact {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal__note {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--mist);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
